kui me

64
00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:41.560
Väike mees, kas ta selle elevandiga

65
00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:47.960
Me saime vanaema vaatama ja vanadest
ka anategi ta vanaema,

66
00:07:47.960 --> 00:07:51.410
