See kael pole üldsegi

120
00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:25.470
Mida allapoole, seda kitsamaks
ja pimedamaks?

121
00:18:03.119 --> 00:18:05.000
Lotiste

122
00:18:05.100 --> 00:18:07.300
lotiste.

123
00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:44.430
Oi, oi, oi, oi, oi, oi, lapsed,
lapsed,

124
